# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:22
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_bc8337af:

    # "While moving around the camp, I picked up a distinct scent that made me stop in my tracks."
    "キャンプ地を移動中、ある独特の匂いがして、思わず足を止めた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:23
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_627fb527:

    # "As I looked around, I listened carefully, and for a moment, I thought perhaps I was wrong; perhaps there was nothing there."
    "周囲を見回し、耳を澄ませながら、一瞬、自分が勘違いしていたのかもしれないと思った。もしかしたら、何もないのかもしれないと。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:24
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_99f44af8:

    # "Then I heard it, that distinct {i}hissing{/i} sound, calling to me."
    "すると聞こえた、あの特徴的な{i}シューッという音{/i}が、私を呼んでいる。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:32
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_167176ed:

    # "Following the voice towards the outskirts of the camp, I found the Skalith waiting for me."
    "声を辿ってキャンプの外れへと向かうと、スケイリスが私を待っていた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:33
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_006492e1:

    # "She let out a low rumble when she saw me, but my eyes were naturally drawn to the round, pregnant belly she tenderly rubbed at."
    "彼女は私を見て低いうなり声を漏らしたが、私の視線はつい自然と、彼女が優しく撫でている丸く膨らんだ妊婦のお腹へと吸い寄せられていった。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:34
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_009ace1c:

    # MC @ surprised "You're-"
    MC @ surprised "あなたはー"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:35
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_d346991d:

    # "I stopped myself. The girl didn't seem to register my words, but she understood my surprise."
    "言いかけてやめた。彼女には言葉は耳には届いていないようだったが、私の驚きは理解した。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:37
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_c1fa40b4:

    # "Stepping forward, she tenderly placed my hands onto her belly for a moment, letting me feel the child moving around inside."
    "一歩踏み出して、彼女はそっと私の手を自分のお腹の上にしばらく置き、中で動き回る子供の気配を感じさせてくれた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:38
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_22694b3a:

    # "As I looked up to her to meet her eyes, she stepped back, turning tail to flee into the distance!"
    "彼女の目を見ようと顔を上げると、彼女は一歩後退し、くるりと背を向けて遠くへ逃げていった!"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:40
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_4f4f1287:

    # MC "Wait! Stop!"
    MC "待って! 止めて!"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:41
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_7a0856e3:

    # MC @ serious "(That Skalith... It came to see me to let me know she carried my child?)"
    MC @ serious "(あのスカリス…私の子を妊娠したと伝えに来たのか？)"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:42
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_a1a776b2:

    # MC @ think "(I thought those things were just mindless killers?)"
    MC @ think "(あれらはただの無差別殺人マシンだと思っていたけど？)"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:46
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_bc8337af:

    # "While moving around the camp, I picked up a distinct scent that made me stop in my tracks."
    "キャンプ場を歩き回っていると、ふとある独特の匂いがして、思わず足を止めた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:47
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_627fb527:

    # "As I looked around, I listened carefully, and for a moment, I thought perhaps I was wrong; perhaps there was nothing there."
    "周囲を見回し、耳をすませた。一瞬、間違っていたのかもしれないと思った。もしかしたら、そこには何もなかったのだ、ただの気のせいかもしれない。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:48
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_99f44af8:

    # "Then I heard it, that distinct {i}hissing{/i} sound, calling to me."
    "その独特の{i}ヒス{/i}という音が、私を呼んでいる。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:56
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_167176ed:

    # "Following the voice towards the outskirts of the camp, I found the Skalith waiting for me."
    "声を辿ってキャンプの外れまで来ると、スケリスが私を待ち受けていた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:57
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_e8c0c1b0:

    # "She let out a low rumble when she saw me, but my eyes were naturally drawn to the small, gurgling, lizard-like child in her arms."
    "彼女は私を見て低く唸ったが、私の目は自然と彼女の腕に抱かれた、小さくゴロゴロと鳴るトカゲのような子供へと吸い寄せられた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:58
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_c9d45596:

    # MC @ surprised "Is that our-"
    MC @ surprised "それは私たちの…"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:59
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_8ffded9c:

    # "The Skalith rumbled soothingly in approval, her eyes filled towards me with... {i}adoration?{/i}"
    "スカリスは満足そうに心地よい音を立て、彼女の目は私に向けられて…{i}愛情？{/i}という感情に満ちていた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:61
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_4811bb6d:

    # "Stepping forward, she let me look closer at our child, who sleepily reached out to grab at one of my fingers and squeeze it tightly."
    "一歩近づき、彼女は私にもっと間近で子どもを見せてくれた。子どもは眠そうに手を伸ばし、私の指を一本掴むと、ぎゅっと握った。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:62
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_84ef6b8d:

    # "Gently, I found my Skalith's mate's clawed hands gently cupping over my crotch as she lightly rubbed against it."
    "優しく、彼女は私の股間に爪のある手をそっと包み込むと、軽くこすりつけてきた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:63
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_1addb147:

    # "Her body secreted that same powerful scent to tell me her intentions without even saying a word."
    "彼女の身体は、一言も発せずとも意思を伝えようとしているかのように、あの強烈な香りを漂わせていた。"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:64
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_5d7be6df:

    # "{i}She wants more offspring, she wants to keep mating...{/i}"
    "{i}彼女はより多くの子孫を欲し、交配を続けたい……{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/rgb_lizards/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:65
translate ja travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_da91d3d4:

    # "We looked into each other's eyes for a moment before she finally stepped back, turning tail to flee into the distance. She hurried off with our child, leaving me to contemplate her...{i}proposal.{/i}"
    "一瞬、お互いの目を見つめ合ってから、彼女はついに後退し、一目散に遠くへ逃げ出した。彼女は我が子を連れて急ぎ去り、私は彼女の…{i}提案{/i}について考えさせられるのだった。"

